('ENT_ZOR_SATAVAESA','Satavaesa','Zoroastrian','Yazata','Astral Deity','Satavaesa; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Astral yazata, the star to whom the waters belong, shed between the earth and the sky (Tir Yasht).','deity'),
('ENT_ZOR_HAPTOIRINGA','Haptoiringa','Zoroastrian','Yazata','Astral Deity','Haptoiringa; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Astral yazata, the seven stars (Ursa Major) invoked to oppose the Yatus and Pairikas (Tir Yasht).','deity'),
('ENT_ZOR_VANANT','Vanant','Zoroastrian','Yazata','Astral Deity','Vanant; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Astral yazata, the star made by Mazda, invoked for strength and victory (Tir Yasht).','deity'),
('ENT_ZOR_PARENDI','Parendi','Zoroastrian','Yazata','Yazata','Parendi; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Yazata of abundance and good fortune, of the swift chariot.','deity'),
('ENT_ZOR_ARSHTAT','Arshtat','Zoroastrian','Yazata','Yazata','Arshtat; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Yazata of rectitude and justice, who makes the world grow.','deity'),
('ENT_ZOR_SAENA','Saena','Zoroastrian','Fravashi','Revered soul','Saena; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'The Fravashi of the holy Saena, son of Ahum-stut, who first appeared on earth with a hundred disciples (Farvardin Yasht).','spirit'),
('ENT_ZOR_FRASHAOSHTRA','Frashaoshtra','Zoroastrian','Fravashi','Revered soul','Frashaoshtra; yazata; Zoroastrian worship','Zoroastrian','Avestan period','A','candidate_verified_name','Avesta (Yasht) primary attestation',1,false,false,'Fravashi of Frashaoshtra, son of Hvova, a foremost disciple of Zoroaster (Farvardin Yasht).','spirit'),
